From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Mar 2026 18:59:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 87/98] refactor(feishu): remove redundant dedup scaffolding
 after race fix

The deliverInFlight guard (2ffebfa6d1) prevents the onIdle/deliver race
that caused duplicate card sends. The symptom-level dedup mechanisms
added while hunting the root cause are now dead code:

- stripTrailingMentionSuffix() and trailing-mention key comparison
- deliveredFinalContentKeys set and buildFinalDeliveryContentKey()
- normalizeFeishuFinalReplyText(), resolveFinalReplyDedupeKey(), and
  deliveredFinalReplyKeys in dispatch-from-config.ts

Retain deliveredFinalTexts as lightweight defense-in-depth.
Replace console.log debug statements with logDispatcher() calls.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
